      "content": "That's a pretty good start, it definitely feels much more intense. The density looks much higher than our previous entries. \n\nHowever, I need to be careful. I don't want the description to feel like a \"word salad\" or just a list of descriptors—if it sounds fake or forced, the museum board will reject it. Please keep a focus on actually being a professional curator and being meaningful. Use the formula as a guide to ensure high quality, but please don't just keyword-stuff or pad it with adjectives just to chase a higher number. I need it to remain sophisticated and authentic.\n\nCan you try another version that is even more 'rich' but stays strictly professional and grounded?",
